 substantive-evidence column with unverified community text. P3 now counts every coverage numerator from ③, so the two edits together inflate coverage. Eight of ten tracks carry annotations. The round-3 plan says annotations are \"leads and `DB등재` material\" and nothing about filling gaps.\n- **Attribution upgrade.** \"원문을 찾기 전까지\" can be met by a snippet that repeats the same quote, which is still a relay. The [26430067] Vulture quote in the block is exactly this case.\n\n**Replacement text (whole added line):**\n\n> Genius 커뮤니티 주석은 이용자가 쓴 미인증 등재 기록이다. [DB등재]로 다루고, 주석이 옮긴 발언은 원 매체에서 해당 구절을 찾기 전까지 [재인용]이다. 같은 인용을 옮긴 다른 자료는 원문으로 보지 않는다. 주석은 원문을 찾는 단서로 쓰고, 주석만으로 ③의 실질 근거를 채우지 않는다. 필요하면 곡별로 한데 모아 둔다.\n\nThis only restricts what annotations can do. It adds no recording duty, so notes should not get longer. The optional subsection is kept because the owner asked for it.\n\nOnce this line is replaced, P3 and P3G are ready to freeze.\n\nOut of scope: when the producer cannot tell its tool-output kind, ① could say \"불명(가공으로 처리)\". The existing default already covers the labels, so this was not raised as an objection."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11392,"cache_read_input_tokens":1807,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11392},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1dd13537-97fa-48c1-8a9b-94d82354d3e4","uuid":"c6bdbec9-04f5-470f-a457-3e8b0a955032","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:53:56.411Z","request_id":"req_011CgBhyUHgXSsvY5MQyj64q"}
